*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%  PPD for the Bixolon XD5-43T shipping-label gateway queue.
*%  Declares A4 as the page size (matching DHL's source PDF) rather than
*%  the physical 4x6in label: if this PPD only offered the label size,
*%  macOS's AirPrint client would pre-scale/fit the whole source page down
*%  onto that tiny paper size itself before the job ever reaches our
*%  filter, crushing both halves of the DHL sheet into one dense, mostly
*%  black mess. Declaring A4 makes macOS pass the page through unscaled so
*%  the bixolonzpl filter can do the real crop/rotate/fit itself.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*LanguageVersion: English
*PCFileName: "BIXLABEL.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Bixolon"
*Product: "(XD5-43T)"
*ModelName: "Bixolon XD5-43T Shipping Label"
*ShortNickName: "Bixolon XD5-43T Label"
*NickName: "Bixolon XD5-43T Shipping Label"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: None
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/vnd.cups-raw 0 bixolonzpl"
*cupsFilter2: "application/postscript application/vnd.cups-raw 0 bixolonzpl"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-postscript application/vnd.cups-raw 0 bixolonzpl"

*OpenUI *PageSize: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: A4
*PageSize A4/A4 (DHL label sheet): ""
*PageSize w288h432/4x6in Label (102x152mm): ""
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: A4
*PageRegion A4/A4 (DHL label sheet): ""
*PageRegion w288h432/4x6in Label (102x152mm): ""
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: A4
*ImageableArea A4/A4 (DHL label sheet): "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea w288h432/4x6in Label (102x152mm): "0 0 288 432"

*DefaultPaperDimension: A4
*PaperDimension A4/A4 (DHL label sheet): "595 842"
*PaperDimension w288h432/4x6in Label (102x152mm): "288 432"

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*%*% End of PPD
